# Environment Variables Template for Private Network Deployment

Copy this file to `.env.local` (or use with GitLab CI/CD variables) and fill in your specific values.

---

## GitLab CE Configuration

```bash
# GitLab hostname/domain
GITLAB_HOSTNAME=gitlab.internal
GITLAB_URL=https://gitlab.internal

# GitLab root password (change immediately after initial login)
GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD=STRONG_ADMIN_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME

# GitLab SSH port for Git operations
GITLAB_SSH_PORT=2222

# GitLab runners configuration
GITLAB_RUNNER_TOKEN=your-project-runner-token-here
GITLAB_RUNNER_TAGS=docker,linux,ai-assistant
```

---

## Harbor Registry Configuration

```bash
# Harbor hostname/domain
HARBOR_HOSTNAME=harbor.internal
HARBOR_REGISTRY=harbor.internal:443
HARBOR_PROJECT=ai-assistant

# Harbor admin credentials
HARBOR_ADMIN_USER=admin
HARBOR_ADMIN_PASSWORD=STRONG_HARBOR_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME

# Harbor database (PostgreSQL)
HARBOR_DB_PASSWORD=STRONG_DB_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME

# Harbor CI/CD bot credentials
HARBOR_CI_USER=ci-bot
HARBOR_CI_PASSWORD=STRONG_CI_BOT_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME

# Harbor storage
HARBOR_DATA_VOLUME=/data/harbor
HARBOR_BACKUP_LOCATION=/backup/harbor
```

---

## Deployment Environment Configuration

```bash
# Development Environment
DEV_SERVER_HOSTNAME=dev-server.internal
DEV_SERVER_IP=192.168.1.100
DEV_GATEWAY_PORT=8080
DEV_N8N_PORT=5678

# Production Environment
PROD_SERVER_HOSTNAME=prod-server.internal
PROD_SERVER_IP=192.168.1.101
PROD_GATEWAY_PORT=8080
PROD_N8N_PORT=5678

# SSH deployment user
DEPLOY_USER=deploy
SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_DEV=/path/to/dev-deploy-key
SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_PROD=/path/to/prod-deploy-key
```

---

## AI Assistant Service Configuration

```bash
# FastAPI Gateway
N8N_WEBHOOK_URL=http://n8n:5678/webhook/ai-gateway
LITELLM_URL=http://litellm:4000/v1/chat/completions
LITELLM_API_KEY=STRONG_LITELLM_API_KEY

# n8n Workflow Engine
N8N_BASIC_AUTH_ACTIVE=false
N8N_EDITOR_BASE_URL=http://n8n.internal:5678

# Database
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=STRONG_DB_PASSWORD
POSTGRES_DB=ai_assistant

# Redis Cache
REDIS_PASSWORD=STRONG_REDIS_PASSWORD

# Qdrant Vector DB
QDRANT_URL=http://qdrant:6333
QDRANT_API_KEY=STRONG_QDRANT_API_KEY
```

