## Network Configuration

```bash
# Network subnet
NETWORK_SUBNET=192.168.1.0/24

# DNS servers (internal)
DNS_SERVER_1=192.168.1.1
DNS_SERVER_2=192.168.1.2

# NTP server (time synchronization)
NTP_SERVER=time.internal.local
```

