## SSL/TLS Certificates

```bash
# Certificate paths (for self-signed)
CERT_DIR=/opt/gitlab/ssl
GITLAB_CERT_PATH=/opt/gitlab/ssl/gitlab.internal.crt
GITLAB_KEY_PATH=/opt/gitlab/ssl/gitlab.internal.key

HARBOR_CERT_PATH=/opt/harbor/certs/server.crt
HARBOR_KEY_PATH=/opt/harbor/certs/server.key

# Or use CA-signed certificates:
# GITLAB_CERT_PATH=/etc/ssl/certs/gitlab.internal.crt
# HARBOR_CERT_PATH=/etc/ssl/certs/harbor.internal.crt
```

---

## Backup Configuration

```bash
# Backup retention
BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30

# Backup locations
GITLAB_BACKUP_PATH=/backup/gitlab
HARBOR_BACKUP_PATH=/backup/harbor
DATABASE_BACKUP_PATH=/backup/database

# Backup schedule (cron format)
GITLAB_BACKUP_SCHEDULE="0 2 * * *"     # Daily at 2 AM
HARBOR_BACKUP_SCHEDULE="0 3 * * *"     # Daily at 3 AM
DATABASE_BACKUP_SCHEDULE="0 4 * * *"   # Daily at 4 AM
```

---

## Logging & Monitoring

```bash
# Log levels
GITLAB_LOG_LEVEL=info
HARBOR_LOG_LEVEL=info
GATEWAY_LOG_LEVEL=info

# Log retention
LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=30

# Monitoring
ENABLE_PROMETHEUS=true
PROMETHEUS_SCRAPE_INTERVAL=15s
ENABLE_GRAFANA=true
```

